{"4187670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Self-Cultivation", "steam_appid": 4187670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At the twilight of the apocalypse, will you be a Zombie Herder, or humanity's Savior?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a crowd, those who stand apart often invite envy or jealousy; those who are stronger may find themselves demanded of even more. Even seclusion in mountain forests cannot sever the world's shackles completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years ago, a biochemical virus swept across the globe. Though humanity fought back with all its might, it could not withstand the relentless waves. Now, the world has fallen into chaos—most of mankind has become the walking dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst this catastrophe, a young girl and her brother struggle to survive. Yet the virus continues to mutate, and the world itself is quietly changing. Some who appear uninfected may have already undergone genetic transformations, while among the walking dead, certain individuals are gradually developing consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl slowly discovers she possesses a unique ability: she can control certain zombies. Others like her—mutated yet asymptomatic—exist in the world, often bearing different powers, but are hunted by local warlord organizations for that very reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it were you, would you choose the so-called future of humanity, or the path of self-preservation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The siblings must face not only zombies, but also evade even more terrifying pursuers. After a sudden accident separates them, the young girl embarks on a long journey to find her brother.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chapter 1, the girl arrives at the great tree where she promised to meet her brother. Delayed along the way, she finds only a letter left behind. Having waited so long, her brother feared the worst and set out for the city to search for her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 serves as an introduction to familiarize players with basic controls and mechanics. Players begin with the first skill: <strong>Capture Skill</strong>, which can capture single or multiple zombies of the same level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured zombies can be issued three commands: <strong>Attack</strong>, <strong>Follow</strong>, and <strong>Standby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players then unlock the second skill: <strong>Control Skill</strong>. This allows precise commands for captured zombies to move or attack designated targets. Players can also upgrade skills to enhance captured zombies' stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 3 unlocks the third skill—<strong>Assimilation</strong>. This ability allows players to temporarily blend into hordes of equal-level zombies without being attacked, significantly boosting health and defense while also enabling them to sense hidden zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich system of <strong>interactive items</strong>. Players can not only use these items directly but also equip their captured zombies and command them to utilize these items. Skillful use of these items is the core strategy for defeating enemies and clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 5 will unlock the Ultimate Skill—<strong>Master Skill</strong>. Players can summon multiple zombies to aid in battle at any time and challenge even more powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's even more exciting content awaiting your discovery!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an extreme survival gameplay mode independent of the main storyline. Your core objective is to survive as long as possible against wave after wave of surging zombies. This mode features an exclusive skill upgrade system and introduces new monster types and items not found in the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assimilation Skill Expansion:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely equip different Monster Cards, each granting the character distinct skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Skill Expansion:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Customization:</strong> The equipped Monster Card directly determines the type and quantity of monsters summoned when you use a skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthesis Upgrade:</strong> In the skill interface, you can merge cards to level up your monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genetic Modification:</strong> Using the unique Genetic Modification feature, you can not only enhance existing monster stats but also breed unprecedented powerful new species through mutation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Supply System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop:</strong> Provides various survival essentials to help you cope with crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storage Box:</strong> Used for properly storing excess supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewards &amp; Growth Mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Rewards:</strong> For every day you successfully survive, you can select one item from a set of random rewards to improve skills or enhance attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective Rewards:</strong> Achieving specific goals grants extra Shop Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Records:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeat, the system automatically saves the detailed data of the run. You can view historical leaderboards sorted by survival days, final score, and time elapsed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for reading and for your support!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At the twilight of the apocalypse, will you be a Zombie Herder, or humanity's Savior?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a crowd, those who stand apart often invite envy or jealousy; those who are stronger may find themselves demanded of even more. Even seclusion in mountain forests cannot sever the world's shackles completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years ago, a biochemical virus swept across the globe. Though humanity fought back with all its might, it could not withstand the relentless waves. Now, the world has fallen into chaos—most of mankind has become the walking dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst this catastrophe, a young girl and her brother struggle to survive. Yet the virus continues to mutate, and the world itself is quietly changing. Some who appear uninfected may have already undergone genetic transformations, while among the walking dead, certain individuals are gradually developing consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl slowly discovers she possesses a unique ability: she can control certain zombies. Others like her—mutated yet asymptomatic—exist in the world, often bearing different powers, but are hunted by local warlord organizations for that very reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it were you, would you choose the so-called future of humanity, or the path of self-preservation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The siblings must face not only zombies, but also evade even more terrifying pursuers. After a sudden accident separates them, the young girl embarks on a long journey to find her brother.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chapter 1, the girl arrives at the great tree where she promised to meet her brother. Delayed along the way, she finds only a letter left behind. Having waited so long, her brother feared the worst and set out for the city to search for her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 serves as an introduction to familiarize players with basic controls and mechanics. Players begin with the first skill: <strong>Capture Skill</strong>, which can capture single or multiple zombies of the same level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/2241da3f8ae4bcb010428e67abba0e2c.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured zombies can be issued three commands: <strong>Attack</strong>, <strong>Follow</strong>, and <strong>Standby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/73d9562a6b1d9b6d061beffe779652d9.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players then unlock the second skill: <strong>Control Skill</strong>. This allows precise commands for captured zombies to move or attack designated targets. Players can also upgrade skills to enhance captured zombies' stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7c3a4cb97cc7fbb2ca005e6b3a597edf.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 3 unlocks the third skill—<strong>Assimilation</strong>. This ability allows players to temporarily blend into hordes of equal-level zombies without being attacked, significantly boosting health and defense while also enabling them to sense hidden zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/48977663845838895c2028281bad75b2.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich system of <strong>interactive items</strong>. Players can not only use these items directly but also equip their captured zombies and command them to utilize these items. Skillful use of these items is the core strategy for defeating enemies and clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/77784af87e1f64ac76399cb5c6dbccf2.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 5 will unlock the Ultimate Skill—<strong>Master Skill</strong>. Players can summon multiple zombies to aid in battle at any time and challenge even more powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f0095b4bef95b843ce8bbbc731f9edf0.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's even more exciting content awaiting your discovery!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an extreme survival gameplay mode independent of the main storyline. Your core objective is to survive as long as possible against wave after wave of surging zombies. This mode features an exclusive skill upgrade system and introduces new monster types and items not found in the main campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assimilation Skill Expansion:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely equip different Monster Cards, each granting the character distinct skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/7df9c8778abeee8706069e24ebf373bd.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Skill Expansion:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Customization:</strong> The equipped Monster Card directly determines the type and quantity of monsters summoned when you use a skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthesis Upgrade:</strong> In the skill interface, you can merge cards to level up your monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/f3b7aebe9fdbd33d2731e1ff281f7255.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genetic Modification:</strong> Using the unique Genetic Modification feature, you can not only enhance existing monster stats but also breed unprecedented powerful new species through mutation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/e2c7c4053ae9789ec14af22d6ebf90ff.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Supply System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop:</strong> Provides various survival essentials to help you cope with crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/76f15d720b9540125973cef967c0f075.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storage Box:</strong> Used for properly storing excess supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewards &amp; Growth Mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Rewards:</strong> For every day you successfully survive, you can select one item from a set of random rewards to improve skills or enhance attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.poster.avif?t=1780045988\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.webm?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/extras/429ef86130e64357b7bf63cd061ca234.mp4?t=1780045988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective Rewards:</strong> Achieving specific goals grants extra Shop Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Records:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeat, the system automatically saves the detailed data of the run. You can view historical leaderboards sorted by survival days, final score, and time elapsed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for reading and for your support!</strong></p>", "short_description": "An extraordinary post-apocalyptic adventure. Play as a girl who controls zombies. Use this power as both weapon and key, strategically command the undead to solve puzzles, overcome dangers, and uncover the truth behind her brother's disappearance.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/66dceb78e114ce2547d7b2d034332259c8c62efe/header.jpg?t=1780045988", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4187670/96caf6c239e93bfa486d4099446b0ff22eeb841c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780045988", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.st